:: music tutorial
 <img src="src/assets/img/tutorial_music.jpg" width="240" height="auto" alt="[alt text goes here]"/>

introduce listening and recreating sounds

[[play the radio|radio]]

[[press red button|noteC]]
[[press yellow button|noteE]]
[[press green button|noteG]]
[[press blue button|noteB]]


[[go back|starting room]]


:: noteC
 <img src="src/assets/img/tutorial_music.jpg" width="240" height="auto" alt="[alt text goes here]"/>
